# About Me
ABOUT_TITLE=About Me
ABOUT_PARAGRAPH= I’m a passionate Software Engineer with strong expertise in Angular, TypeScript, React / Next JS and modern front-end technologies like Tailwind, Prime NG, Material, Bootstrap, and responsive design. I have hands-on experience building scalable web applications, integrating RESTful APIs, and contributing to full-stack projects with C#, Node.js, and SQL. In addition to development, I’ve worked on DevOps pipelines using Azure Dev ops, Jenkins and Docker, helping streamline deployments and improve delivery efficiency. I’m driven by clean code, continuous learning, and being part of collaborative teams that build purposeful tech.


