# Experience 1
EXP1_COMPANY=Cognity A.E
EXP1_COMPANY_SHORT=Cognity
EXP1_ROLE=Angular Developer / Team Leader
EXP1_ROLE_SHORT=Angular Team Leader
EXP1_DATES=Feb 2022 - Apr 2023
EXP1_DESC1=Refactored a legacy ASPX-based banking system into a modern Angular UI, improving maintainability, usability, and frontend architecture.
EXP1_DESC2=Led development and maintenance of an Angular-based insurance sales platform, supporting secure operations, deployments, and stable production delivery.
EXP1_DESC3=Collaborated with stakeholders and backend teams to capture requirements, align implementation details, and ensure seamless system integration.
EXP1_DESC4=Conducted code reviews, enforced frontend best practices, maintained code quality, and mentored junior developers within the team.

# Experience 2
EXP2_COMPANY=Singular Logic S.A
EXP2_COMPANY_SHORT=Singular Logic
EXP2_ROLE=Angular Developer / DevOps Engineer
EXP2_ROLE_SHORT=Angular / DevOps
EXP2_DATES=Apr 2023 - Oct 2025
EXP2_DESC1=Developed scalable Angular applications across travel authorization, ticketing, eCommerce, government, ERP, and fuel management platforms, addressing diverse business and user needs.
EXP2_DESC2=Built reusable, templated frontend solutions using custom Angular components and integrated APIs to support dynamic data, user interactions, and platform-specific workflows.
EXP2_DESC3=Led the refactoring and upgrade of the EuroElections 2024 voting system from Angular 7 to 18 using Angular Signals, improving performance and maintainability.
EXP2_DESC4=Refactored ERP and fuel station systems using NgRx, responsive design, Jenkins, Docker, and CI/CD practices.

# Experience 3
