EXP3_ROLE=Angular Developer / Full Stack
EXP3_ROLE_SHORT=Angular / Full Stack
EXP3_DATES=Oct 2025 - Now
EXP3_DESC1=Contributed to the redesign and modernization of a large-scale eBanking platform, migrating legacy AngularJS functionality to the latest Angular ecosystem.
EXP3_DESC2=Implemented complex banking workflows across payments, transfers, approvals, and multi-step transactional journeys, ensuring accuracy, usability, and reliable business logic.
EXP3_DESC3=Translated Figma designs into responsive, production-ready Angular interfaces, supporting rebranding, design consistency, and seamless user experience across devices.
EXP3_DESC4=Worked on .NET BFF implementations, unit testing, Azure DevOps pipelines, release processes, debugging, refactoring, and maintainable enterprise delivery.


